    "ja": "人喰い鬼の花嫁"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Bride of the Man-Eating Demon"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "It's always been you that I've wanted. Ever since she was a child, Riko has been bullied for her crimson eyes, with people calling her \"filthy\" and \"cursed by a monster.\" She marries Shuten-doji, a man-eater, in place of her sister, and heads to the mansion, prepared to die. But beneath the cherry blossoms, a demon stands, smiling---? Does the crimson eyes reflect fear, or love? It's a tale of interspecies marriage, as fleeting as a dream."
  },
